{"id":"u-fc97d67a-5ef5-4f12-abd5-94bd78ccf276","src":"community","title":"The King Engine (4 days, Push/Pull Variation)","author":"Jaron Z.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/xwNT53-the-king-engine-4-days-full-body-1","desc":"4 day per week, upper body focused program. Decent amout of volume with high intensity.\n\n-Don't worry about trying to hit the top end of the rep ranges, just make sure your reps don't fall below the minimum rep range. \n\n-There should be some rep dropoff set to set. If your reps don't drop from the 1st set vs the last set, you're not training close enough to failure.\n\n-Each week try to add 5-10 pounds to compound lifts (2.5 pounds for isolations) and match reps from the previous week's session. OR beat your reps by 1 from the previous week's session, with the same weight from the previous week.\n\n-Note: \n*The first set of each exercise is the one you're trying to match/beat reps from the previous week. This is how you're going to gauge performance. \n\n-Matching subsequent sets isn't as important, although performance should be similar to the previous week's session.\n\n-If you're unable to match, or beat reps, stick with the same weight next week, until you can beat your reps; then repeat.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":3,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-07T03:03:57.633Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push 1","Pull 1","Push 2","Pull 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Fly Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":20,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"